{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396640/extras/flycatchfoxgif1-33fps.gif?t=1739307962\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u30fbAn explorative and beautiful action game</strong></h2>Catch foxes on many unique levels with different strategies to succeed. Fly from cliffs and swoop in on unsuspecting foxes.<br><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396640/extras/zombiefoxeschasinggif.gif?t=1739307962\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u30fbOr play zombie mode and run away from the foxes instead!</strong></h2>The zombie foxes are out to get you, and they speed up as time goes on! How long can you survive by jumping off a mountain and hang gliding away at just the right moment, or chaining powerups to run faster?<br><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396640/extras/menuselectgif-15fps.gif?t=1739307962\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u30fbSpeed boosts and record times</strong></h2>Set high scores for each level, and unlock many levels to advance through the game. Both modes have their own highscore list and level unlocks. <br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396640/extras/levelshowoffGIF-15fps.gif?t=1739307962\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u30fbFun and varied level design</strong></h2>Zoom across many types of levels from jungles to oceans to fractals, with different looks and geographical features, allowing for varied strategies and approaches. Explore to find an altar where foxes gather, focus on one fox as it gets faster and faster, go for the powerups, and fly forward after you jump from mountaintops.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"What Does the Fox Say?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2396640/5c330250ba9fe63e5c564d1aa329394a44351004.jpg"},{"name":"I Love Gold!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2396640/19740adcdaf2c9530a12b03aa80d279acb89293b.jpg"},{"name":"Loop It Back Around","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2396640/7854f3b67304f38346b1fb3f78f00802a06953ef.jpg"},{"name":"A Century Of Fox","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2396640/ef4071b8f09b01edb0ad28a521f1991d73ba8593.jpg"},{"name":"I Would Walk 500 Foxes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2396640/c3fd75a71140edeececcc143081d1ec689193760.jpg"},{"name":"One Kilo-Fox","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2396640/9bedeeff4c82fbe3975f0d854515780dad8f0274.jpg"},{"name":"You Are Ruined","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2396640/1aaf939992594dcb67bf109157f6a3bc79d5a7c6.jpg"},{"name":"Three-Phase Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2396640/d65dddaa076a1e91744402fda4fd6f6459d5afb8.jpg"},{"name":"Lightning Marathon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2396640/f1bf1224c55967ddbe1c73eaffa8036948e0ae1e.jpg"},{"name":"Like Walking Through Molasses","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2396640/618d1164914a9e1c1d2d56aabd4b80d9b7e4a5c5.jpg"}],"total":53},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2396640?t=1739307962","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2396640?t=1739307962","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739307962","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739307962","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"desc